ZigBee Key Fob 205 is a multi-functional key fob for sensing monitoring. It is portable and easy to install. KF205 can deploy and remove the security system through the upper and lower buttons and control the light equipment or energy equipment remotely by the left and right buttons.

## Key Features

- ZigBee HA 1.2
- Remote switch controlling
- Remote security system deployment and removal
- Low power consumption (standby ≤4μA)
- Mini size, easy installation
